# Network Design

## Area Assignment

| Router | OSPF Area(s) |
|---------|--------------|
| R1 | Area 2 |
| R2 | Area 2 |
| R3 | Area 0 & Area 2 (ABR) |
| R4 | Area 0 |

R3 functions as the **Area Border Router (ABR)** between Area 0 and Area 2.

---

# Router Configuration

Each router was configured with:

- Hostname
- Interface IP addresses
- Loopback interface
- OSPF Router ID
- OSPF network statements
- Passive interfaces where appropriate

Example (R1)

```cisco
router ospf 50

router-id 1.1.1.1

network 77.77.82.128 0.0.0.127 area 2
network 200.10.82.0 0.0.0.3 area 2
network 200.10.82.8 0.0.0.3 area 2
network 55.0.0.1 0.0.0.0 area 2

passive-interface FastEthernet0/0
passive-interface Loopback0
```

