# OSPF Cost Manipulation

One objective of this lab was to influence route selection by modifying OSPF interface costs.

The following interfaces were configured with higher costs.

### R1

```cisco
interface Serial0/2/0

ip ospf cost 50
```

### R3

```cisco
interface Serial0/2/1

ip ospf cost 50
```

Increasing the interface cost made these links less desirable during SPF calculations, causing OSPF to prefer alternate paths with lower cumulative costs.

