# Results

The lab successfully demonstrated:

- Stable OSPF neighbor adjacencies
- Successful inter-area routing
- Route summarization through the Area Border Router
- Dynamic SPF recalculation
- Cost-based path selection
- End-to-end connectivity between both LANs

Changing interface costs caused OSPF to install alternate shortest paths without manual routing changes, illustrating the protocol's dynamic convergence capabilities.

